  "contentHtml": "<p>1차시 실험보고서를&#160;검사하다 보니</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 실험 결과 표를 제대로 완성하지 못함.</p><p>2. 결과와 결론을 제대로 설명하지 못함. 의 문제를 발견했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그래서&#160;</p><p>결과분석 피드백 수업을 계획하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래의 학습지</p><p>&lt;실험1&gt;은 다같이 분석해보는 연습 활동입니다.</p><p>- 연역적 탐구과정을 이해하도록 구성하였습니다.</p><p>- 실험 결과를 표로 제시하고 그 결과를 분석하게 하였습니다.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 75.1238%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d4c421e09c069c888f5ccc2d0a8b7e4183e32f9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d4c421e09c069c888f5ccc2d0a8b7e4183e32f9\" data-origin-width=\"566\" data-origin-height=\"489\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aa2d523da7319f3541aeff7c9ac8034d8416a752\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aa2d523da7319f3541aeff7c9ac8034d8416a752\" data-origin-width=\"740\" data-origin-height=\"363\"></div><p>&lt;실험2&gt;는</p><p>내가 1차시에 했던 실험을 다시 작성해보는 활동입니다.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 74.8762%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ffa3dcbb5a9b6d1bbf8bdf7362b4325b2522eae8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ffa3dcbb5a9b6d1bbf8bdf7362b4325b2522eae8\" data-origin-width=\"555\" data-origin-height=\"403\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/12d34288aff0d30cf09702631714ce60dcdc6580\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/12d34288aff0d30cf09702631714ce60dcdc6580\" data-origin-width=\"667\" data-origin-height=\"510\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>특히&#160;</p><p>1차시에 표를 제대로 그리지 못한 학생들이</p><p>2차시에는 제대로 표현하고 있음을 확인하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>또한</p><p>자신이 작성한 &lt;실험2&gt; 보고서를 사진 찍어서&#160;</p><p>AI에게 피드백 받아서</p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>빨간펜</b></span>으로 작성하게 하였습니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/99045e62e5a48092ec7a4daec5ae80d8ed9ff73e?download\" data-file-name=\"발효 실험 분석활동(김영학).hwpx\" data-file-size=\"31915\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Ddglf%26dataid%3D267%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20260520130028&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F99045e62e5a48092ec7a4daec5ae80d8ed9ff73e')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">발효 실험 분석활동(김영학)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">31.17KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
